---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Compass from '../components/village/Compass.astro';
import HouseholdReader from '../components/village/HouseholdReader.astro';
const households=(await getCollection('households')).sort((a,b)=>a.data.number-b.data.number);
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Explore Mushroom Green in 1865: a remembered village of cottages, working yards, lanes, and family stories."/><title>Mushroom Green · A village remembered</title></head>
<body><main id="village-app">
<div id="village-canvas" aria-label="Interactive Mushroom Green village"></div>
<header><a href="/" class="eyebrow">THE BOOK OF WEAVER <span>/</span> 1865</a><h1>Mushroom Green<span>.</span></h1><p>A village of small homes. A world of shared lives.</p><div class="views" role="group" aria-label="Explore the village"><button disabled data-view="village" aria-pressed="true">The village</button><button disabled data-view="approach" aria-pressed="false">The approach</button><button disabled data-view="henry" aria-pressed="false">Henry’s home</button><button disabled data-view="lane" aria-pressed="false">Along the lane</button><button disabled data-view="brook" aria-pressed="false">The brook</button><button disabled data-view="forge" aria-pressed="false">Chainshop</button><button disabled data-view="workings" aria-pressed="false">Old workings</button><button disabled data-view="workshops" aria-pressed="false">Backyard shops</button></div></header>
<div class="zoom-controls" role="group" aria-label="View navigation"><span class="control-label">Turn</span><div class="pan-pad turn-pad" role="group" aria-label="Turn the view"><button disabled id="turn-up" aria-label="Turn up" title="Turn up (Shift + ↑)">↑</button><button disabled id="turn-left" aria-label="Turn left" title="Turn left (Shift + ←)">↶</button><button disabled id="turn-right" aria-label="Turn right" title="Turn right (Shift + →)">↷</button><button disabled id="turn-down" aria-label="Turn down" title="Turn down (Shift + ↓)">↓</button></div><span class="control-label">Move</span><div class="pan-pad" role="group" aria-label="Move the view"><button disabled id="pan-up" aria-label="Move up" title="Move up (↑)">↑</button><button disabled id="pan-left" aria-label="Move left" title="Move left (←)">←</button><button disabled id="pan-right" aria-label="Move right" title="Move right (→)">→</button><button disabled id="pan-down" aria-label="Move down" title="Move down (↓)">↓</button></div><div class="zoom-pair"><button disabled id="zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in" title="Zoom in (+)">+</button><button disabled id="zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out" title="Zoom out (−)">−</button></div></div>
<div class="edition">A PLACE REMEMBERED <b>02 / VILLAGE</b></div>
<Compass/>
<HouseholdReader/>
<div id="room-controls" hidden><p id="room-level" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="room-floor" hidden>Go upstairs</button><button id="room-cutaway">View cutaway</button><button id="leave-room">Back outside</button></div>
<section id="interior-toolbar" hidden aria-label="Interior controls"><div><span class="eyebrow">AN INTERPRETED INTERIOR</span><h2 id="interior-title"></h2><p>Drag to turn · Scroll to look closer</p><p id="interior-evidence"></p></div><select id="interior-floor" aria-label="Choose floor"></select><button id="watch-worker" hidden>Watch chainmaker</button><button id="interior-motion" aria-pressed="false">Pause</button><button id="interior-sound" class="sound-toggle" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Sound on" title="Sound on"></button><button id="leave-interior">Back outside</button></section>
<aside id="notes-panel" hidden><button disabled id="close-notes" aria-label="Close village notes">×</button><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS PLACE</div><h2>Built around<br/>working lives.</h2><p>The village lanes, brooks, greens, and household positions follow the family map. The cottages, yards, and connecting footpaths are artistic interpretations. The broad slopes use modern Environment Agency elevation data, smoothed to remove small ground features. Local building platforms and stream beds are interpreted.</p><p>The outside road follows an approximate trace of the historic OS map held by the National Library of Scotland. The local sheet was surveyed in 1881–1882, after our 1865 setting. The road bends closer to the hamlet than its modern route. Railway routes, the edge of an old clay pit, covered shafts and small wet hollows also draw on that later map. Their depths, materials and condition are interpretations. The mapped brickkilns lie beyond this scene.</p><p>Local brick, patched limewash, dark clay tiles, and repaired stores suggest a hamlet built and altered over generations. Chainmaking took place in small workshops beside homes. Most cottage yards now have a small interpreted nail or chain shop, with an open working doorway. Unequal gardens and mixed boundaries leave room for access. Soot and scale gather around the work; entrances carry some dirt indoors, while household surfaces show care as well as age. The strongest workshop photographs date from 1906, later than this 1865 interpretation. Exact furnishings and sanitary arrangements remain uncertain.</p><p>The forge follows the modern chainshop location shown on Google Maps. Building shapes and their 1865 use remain interpretations. The smaller shop beside Henry’s home interprets the reported workshop site at the roadside end of the house.</p><a href="https://warwick.ac.uk/services/library/mrc/collections/digital/tradeboard/chainmakers/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See the chainmaking archive ↗</a><a href="/forge">Explore the forge study ↗</a><a href="/legacy-map">Open the family map ↗</a><a href="https://maps.nls.uk/geo/explore/#zoom=17.3&amp;lat=52.47692&amp;lon=-2.09059&amp;layers=257&amp;b=ESRIWorld&amp;o=100" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See the historic OS map · NLS (CC-BY) ↗</a><p class="attribution">Family research and mapping by Mike Mushroom. Terrain: © Environment Agency copyright and/or database right 2022. All rights reserved. Map data © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>.</p><a href="https://www.dudley.gov.uk/media/3xcfak1v/mushroom-green-guidance-note-22.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Read the local history ↗</a></aside>
<button id="restore-interface" hidden aria-label="Show interface">Show controls</button>
<div id="map-labels" aria-label="Household labels"></div>
<div id="loading" role="status"><span class="spinner"></span><span id="load-label">Finding our way home…</span></div>
<footer><div class="caption"><i></i><div><strong id="place-label">Mushroom Green, Black Country</strong><small>59 households · an interpretation of 1865</small></div></div><nav aria-label="Village controls"><label class="select-label" for="house-select">Find a household</label><select disabled id="house-select" aria-label="Find a household"><option value="">Find a household…</option>{households.map(h=><option value={h.data.number}>{h.data.number}. {h.data.household_name}</option>)}</select><button disabled id="labels-toggle" aria-pressed="false">House labels</button><button disabled id="map-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Map overlay</button><button disabled id="light" aria-pressed="false">Daylight</button><button disabled id="motion" aria-pressed="false">Pause</button><button disabled id="sound" class="sound-toggle" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Sound on" title="Sound on — brook, birdsong and the chainshop anvil"></button><button disabled id="save-view" aria-label="Save picture" title="Save a clean picture">↓</button><button disabled id="clean-view" aria-label="Hide interface" title="Hide interface (H)">◱</button><button disabled id="notes" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="notes-panel" aria-label="About this village">i</button></nav><div class="hint">DRAG TO EXPLORE <span>·</span> SCROLL TO MOVE CLOSER <span>·</span> SELECT A HOME</div></footer>
<dialog id="picture-preview" aria-label="Village picture"><button id="close-picture" aria-label="Close picture">×</button><img id="picture-image" alt="A clean view of Mushroom Green"/><a id="picture-download">Download PNG · 1920 × 1080</a></dialog>
<div class="sr-only" id="village-status" role="status"></div>
</main><script>import '../scripts/village/scene';</script></body></html>
<style is:global>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#c4c7b9;color:#2f3c31;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}button,select{font:inherit}button,a,select{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #98683e;outline-offset:4px}button{cursor:pointer}#village-app,#village-canvas{position:absolute;inset:0}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}header{position:absolute;top:34px;left:40px;pointer-events:none}header a,header button{pointer-events:auto}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.eyebrow span{padding:0 13px;opacity:.4}h1{font:400 clamp(35px,4.3vw,60px)/1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:18px 0 12px}h1 span{color:#976443}header p{font-size:11px;color:#64705e;margin:0}.views{margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:470px}.views button{border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:#e4e5d9b0;padding:8px 2px;color:#53614e;font-size:11px}.views button[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#916542;color:#273729}.edition{position:absolute;right:40px;top:40px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.7px}.edition b{font-weight:400;color:#69715f;margin-left:24px}footer{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0;height:115px;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(transparent,#c4c7b98c)}.caption{position:absolute;bottom:40px;left:40px;display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center}.caption i{width:24px;height:1px;background:#73816c}.caption strong{font:400 15px Georgia,serif}.caption small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.3px;color:#65715c;margin-top:6px}nav{position:absolute;bottom:35px;right:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:7px;background:#f7f4eaeF;border:1px solid #ffffff88;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 6px 35px #25332618;pointer-events:auto}nav button,nav select{background:transparent;border:0;padding:10px;color:#44533e;font-size:10px;border-radius:4px;min-height:36px}nav button:hover,nav button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e6e5d6}nav select{width:158px;cursor:pointer}nav #notes{font:17px Georgia,serif;width:33px}.select-label,.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}.hint{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:40px;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#64715e}.hint span{padding:0 8px}aside{position:absolute;right:34px;top:90px;width:295px;padding:27px;background:#f6f2e8f2;border:1px solid #fff9;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 10px 40px #24302016;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);z-index:3}aside h2{font:400 28px/1.12 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.7px;margin:19px 0}aside p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#626654}aside a{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#815a36;margin:18px 0 0}aside>button:first-child{position:absolute;right:12px;top:10px;background:none;border:0;font-size:21px;color:#66715e}#visit-house{border:1px solid #8d967633;background:#e7e7d6;color:#48543a;padding:10px 15px;margin-top:18px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px}#loading{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);padding:19px 24px;background:#f8f5eeed;border-radius:7px;display:flex;gap:13px;font-size:12px;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap}#loading[hidden],aside[hidden]{display:none}.spinner{width:17px;height:17px;border:1px solid #65735c;border-top-color:transparent;border-radius:50%;animation:spin 1s linear infinite}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}#map-labels{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}.map-label{position:absolute;font:10px Georgia,serif;background:#f4efddea;padding:3px 5px;border:1px solid #8c794c66;border-radius:3px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);white-space:nowrap}#village-app[data-view]:not([data-view=village]) header{background:#e7e8dddc;padding:18px 21px;top:20px;left:20px;border-radius:6px}#village-app[data-view]:not([data-view=village]) h1{font-size:33px;margin-bottom:0}#village-app[data-view]:not([data-view=village]) header p{display:none}#village-app[data-view]:not([data-view=village]) .views{margin-top:12px}#village-app[data-light=dusk] .caption,#village-app[data-light=dusk] .edition{color:#efeadb}
@media(max-width:1050px){.caption{bottom:105px}.hint{left:0;right:0;text-align:center}nav{right:50%;transform:translateX(50%);bottom:34px}.edition b{display:none}}
@media(max-width:640px){header{top:27px;left:23px}h1{font-size:38px}.eyebrow{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px}header p{font-size:10px}.edition{display:none}.views{gap:12px}.views button{font-size:10px}nav{width:calc(100% - 24px);justify-content:center;padding:5px;gap:0}nav button{padding:9px 6px;font-size:9px}nav select{width:123px;font-size:9px;padding:9px 4px}.caption{left:24px;bottom:98px}.caption strong{font-size:13px}.hint{font-size:6px;letter-spacing:.7px}aside{top:auto;bottom:145px;right:16px;width:calc(100% - 32px);max-height:55vh;overflow:auto}aside h2{font-size:24px}#village-app[data-view]:not([data-view=village]) header{left:12px;top:12px;padding:14px}#village-app[data-view]:not([data-view=village]) h1{font-size:28px}}
@media(min-width:641px){#notes-panel{max-height:calc(100vh - 130px);overflow-y:auto}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.spinner{animation:none}}
</style>

<style is:global>@media(max-width:640px){.views{max-width:340px;gap:6px 12px}.views button{padding:6px 2px}}</style>

<style is:global>.zoom-controls{position:absolute;right:36px;bottom:112px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;padding:4px;background:#f7f4eaef;border:1px solid #fff8;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 6px 25px #25332620}.zoom-controls button{width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:transparent;color:#44533e;font:26px Georgia,serif}.zoom-controls button:hover{background:#e6e5d6}@media(max-width:640px){.zoom-controls{right:12px;bottom:150px}}</style>

<style is:global>#restore-interface{position:absolute;bottom:20px;right:20px;z-index:10;background:#f7f4eadd;border:1px solid #fff8;border-radius:4px;padding:10px;color:#44533e;font-size:11px}#village-app[data-clean=true] header,#village-app[data-clean=true] footer,#village-app[data-clean=true] .edition,#village-app[data-clean=true] .zoom-controls,#village-app[data-clean=true] aside{display:none}#village-app[data-clean=true] #restore-interface{opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s}#village-app[data-clean=true] #restore-interface:hover,#village-app[data-clean=true] #restore-interface:focus-visible{opacity:1}</style>

<style is:global>#picture-preview{border:1px solid #fff8;border-radius:8px;background:#edece1;padding:32px 16px 18px;width:min(1050px,94vw);max-height:94vh}#picture-preview::backdrop{background:#17201dcc}#picture-image{display:block;width:100%;max-height:76vh;object-fit:contain}#picture-download{display:block;margin-top:12px;text-align:center;color:#526043;font-size:13px}#close-picture{position:absolute;right:8px;top:4px;background:none;border:0;color:#526043;font-size:24px}</style>

<style is:global>
#interior-toolbar{position:absolute;top:22px;right:22px;z-index:5;background:#f7f3e9f5;border:1px solid #fff8;border-radius:8px;padding:20px 24px;max-width:390px;box-shadow:0 12px 45px #20362b22}#interior-toolbar[hidden]{display:none}.sound-toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;vertical-align:middle;min-width:42px}#interior-toolbar h2{font:25px Georgia,serif;margin:9px 0}#interior-toolbar p{font-size:11px;color:#6c725f;margin:8px 0 14px}#interior-toolbar button,#interior-toolbar select{vertical-align:middle;padding:10px 12px;min-height:42px;background:#e3e4d7;color:#354b3d;border:1px solid #63765d33;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px}#interior-toolbar select{margin-right:8px;max-width:180px}#village-app[data-interior] .edition,#village-app[data-interior] .zoom-controls,#village-app[data-interior] footer{display:none}#village-app[data-interior] header .views{display:none}@media(max-width:640px){#village-app[data-interior] header{display:none}#interior-toolbar{top:auto;bottom:12px;left:12px;right:12px;max-width:none;padding:15px 18px}#interior-toolbar h2{font-size:21px}}
</style>

<style is:global>#room-controls{position:absolute;left:40px;bottom:92px;z-index:2}#room-controls button{background:#f7f4eaef;color:#44533e;border:1px solid #fff8;border-radius:5px;padding:12px 18px;font-size:12px}#village-app[data-clean=true] #room-controls{display:none}@media(max-width:1050px){#room-controls{bottom:145px;left:24px}}</style>

<style is:global>.zoom-controls{gap:7px;padding:7px;align-items:center}.pan-pad{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,36px);grid-template-rows:repeat(3,34px);gap:1px}.zoom-controls .pan-pad button{width:36px;height:34px;font:20px Arial}.pan-pad #pan-up{grid-area:1/2}.pan-pad #pan-left{grid-area:2/1}.pan-pad #pan-right{grid-area:2/3}.pan-pad #pan-down{grid-area:3/2}.zoom-pair{display:flex;border-top:1px solid #65735c26;padding-top:4px;width:100%;justify-content:center}.zoom-pair button{width:50%;height:38px}.zoom-controls button{touch-action:none;user-select:none}#room-controls button+button{margin-left:7px}#room-cutaway{background:#e0dfd0!important}@media(max-width:640px){.zoom-controls{bottom:145px}.pan-pad{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,32px);grid-template-rows:repeat(3,31px)}.zoom-controls .pan-pad button{width:32px;height:31px}}</style>

<style is:global>.control-label{font:10px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64705c}.pan-pad #turn-up{grid-area:1/2}.pan-pad #turn-left{grid-area:2/1}.pan-pad #turn-right{grid-area:2/3}.pan-pad #turn-down{grid-area:3/2}.zoom-controls{gap:3px}.turn-pad{border-bottom:1px solid #65735c26;padding-bottom:5px}.zoom-controls button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #64705c;outline-offset:-2px}@media(max-height:650px){.zoom-controls .pan-pad{grid-template-rows:repeat(3,25px)}.zoom-controls .pan-pad button{height:25px}}</style>

<style is:global>#room-level{margin:0 0 7px;padding:8px 12px;background:#f7f4eaef;color:#44533e;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;max-width:340px}#room-floor{background:#344b3a!important;color:#fff!important}#interior-evidence{max-width:280px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}</style>

<style is:global>
#map-labels[hidden],.map-label[hidden]{display:none}.map-label{transform:none;height:22px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;font:10px/16px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:center;padding:2px 5px;pointer-events:auto;box-shadow:0 1px 5px #29302020}.map-label:hover,.map-label:focus-visible{z-index:2;background:#fffbee;overflow:visible;width:auto!important}.house-label-leaders{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none}.house-label-leaders path{stroke:#e7e2cacc;stroke-width:1;fill:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 1px #172517)}#village-app[data-clean=true] #map-labels{display:none}@media(max-width:640px){footer nav{flex-wrap:wrap}footer nav #house-select{width:145px}.zoom-controls{bottom:169px}}
</style>
